   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SEM301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbooks: <strong>Semantics a Coursebook</strong>; <strong>Semantics a Coursebook (Answer Key)</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13946 · Decision 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 07/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SEM301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Semantics a Coursebook</strong>; <strong>Semantics a Coursebook (Answer Key)</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13946 · QĐ 968/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 07/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Lexical Semantics: Cambridge textbooks in Linguistics</strong></td><td>D.A.Cruse</td><td>Cambdridge University Press</td><td>1986 September</td><td></td><td><code>9780521276436</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Meaning in English: An Introduction</strong></td><td>Javier Valenzuela</td><td>Cambridge University Press</td><td>2017 April</td><td></td><td><code>9781107096370</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Semantics a Coursebook</strong></td><td>James R. Hurford et al</td><td>Cambridge University Press</td><td>2007 April</td><td>2nd ed.</td><td><code>9780521671873</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Semantics a Coursebook (Answer Key)</strong></td><td>James R. Hurford et al</td><td>Cambridge University Press</td><td>2007 April</td><td>2nd ed.</td><td><code>9780521671873</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>the answer key is inbook detailed in each unit's exercises</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Semantics a Coursebook : Teacher's Resource</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>Coursebook, Teacher's Book, pptx, handouts, internet<br><br>Tech Tools:<br><br>- Grammarly<br><br>- ChatGPT/Gemini/Copilot<br><br>- <a href=\"https://spacy.io/usage/linguistic-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://spacy.io/usage/linguistic-features</a><br><br>- Discourse Analyzer AI Toolkit<br><br>- Microsoft Azure Text Analytics<br><br>- MonkeyLearn<br><br>- Lingtree<br><br>- Linguistics Tree Solver</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>Coursebook, Teacher's Book, pptx, handouts, internet<br><br>Tech Tools:<br><br>- Grammarly<br><br>- ChatGPT/Gemini/Copilot<br><br>- <a href=\"https://spacy.io/usage/linguistic-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://spacy.io/usage/linguistic-features</a><br><br>- Discourse Analyzer AI Toolkit<br><br>- Microsoft Azure Text Analytics<br><br>- MonkeyLearn<br><br>- Lingtree<br><br>- Linguistics Tree Solver</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13946\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13946</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13946\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13946</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
